%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1d779d4715048234dbbf2415be188cb0, type: 3}
  m_Name: LightsInTheWoods
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Title: LightsInTheWoods
  Prompt: As the trees grow dense and the sun begins to hide from your view, a faint
    blue glow begins to fill the woods. Several glowing spheres of light dance before
    your party, beckoning deeper into the trees.
  Sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4d31e84cf0dd4bc4a9cbf4b1890ee6ba, type: 3}
  ChoicesToDisplay: 2
  Choices:
  - Text: Follow the lights!
    SuccessChance: 0.55
    _successText: Adventurer
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: Pushing aside a dense net of branches, you come across a dishevelled
        adventurer lying on the ground. They appear desperately lost, and welcome
        your assistance in finding the path. It does not matter if you seek the same
        gold or glory at the end of your adventure - you are stronger together, and
        they offer to join your party.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 5
        _moneyDelta: 0
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: It's a fool's errand to venture off-trail following some strange spirits,
        and only one of your adventurers is brave and stupid enough to dare doing
        so. The rest of the party makes camp, and awaits their return. Minutes, and
        eventually hours pass. The forest is quiet. As morning songbirds mockingly
        sing their cheerful tunes, you must accept that your friend is gone forever.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 4
        _moneyDelta: 0
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
  - Text: Stay on the path.
    SuccessChance: 1
    _successText: 
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: As you continue down the path, you can't help but feel that you made
        the right decision. Far too many stories of poor travellers led astray by
        malevolent spirits...
      Outcomes: []
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: 
      Outcomes: []
